Subject: [PATCH 2/3] extension file naming: member-only and
 standard-library-conformance extension files merge into their type's own file
 (overnight/merge-extension-files.py); single type per file: additional types
 move to their own <Parent>.<Name>.swift inside the container's extension
 (overnight/split-types.py); parse-checked; builds pending (coenttb/work#242)

---
 .../Cardinal/Algebra/Cardinal+Monoid.swift    | 16 ------
 ...rdinal+Swift.CustomStringConvertible.swift |  8 ---
 ...al+Swift.ExpressibleByIntegerLiteral.swift | 12 -----
 ...inal+Swift.Hashable+Swift.Comparable.swift | 11 ----
 Sources/Cardinal/Cardinal.swift               | 51 +++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 Sources/Cardinal/Algebra/Cardinal+Monoid.swift
 delete mode 100644 Sources/Cardinal/Cardinal+Swift.CustomStringConvertible.swift
 delete mode 100644 Sources/Cardinal/Cardinal+Swift.ExpressibleByIntegerLiteral.swift
 delete mode 100644 Sources/Cardinal/Cardinal+Swift.Hashable+Swift.Comparable.swift

